msgid "This would trigger the following kernel entry point in the AST:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AttributeReference.md:13484
msgid "Type Attributes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AttributeReference.md:13488
msgid "SYCL Address Spaces"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AttributeReference.md:13502
msgid ""
"`clang::sycl_constant` <br/> `clang::sycl_generic` <br/> "
"`clang::sycl_global` <br/> `clang::sycl_local` <br/> `clang::sycl_private`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AttributeReference.md:13512
msgid ""
"These attributes are intended for use in the implementation of SYCL run-time "
"libraries and should not be used in any other context. Programmers writing "
"code intended to conform to the SYCL specification should use the address "
"space facilities specified in the following sections of the SYCL 2020 "
"specification."
msgstr ""

